# patchelf
### A tool of the build machine (lfs/patchelf:native): the post-build scripts of lfs/glibc:cross and
### lfs/gobject-introspection:cross rewrite the RUNPATH of what they install with it
PKG_VER=0.19.1
PKG_URL="https://github.com/NixOS/patchelf/releases/download/${PKG_VER}/patchelf-${PKG_VER}.tar.bz2"
BUILD_PROCESS=configmake
PKG_MAKETARGETS="all,install-strip"
